Third-Party Dependencies:
This software incorporates or depends on the following third-party tools and libraries, each subject to their own licenses:

1. ANTs (Advanced Normalization Tools) - N4 Bias Field Correction
   - License: Apache 2.0 / BSD-style
   - Source: https://github.com/ANTsX/ANTs
   - Citation required when using N4 correction

2. Convert3D (c3d) - NIFTI volume manipulation
   - License: GPL
   - Source: http://www.itksnap.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php?n=Convert3D.Convert3D

3. dcm2niix - DICOM to NIFTI conversion
   - License: BSD-2-Clause
   - Source: https://github.com/rordenlab/dcm2niix

4. FSL (FMRIB Software Library) - SUSAN filter
   - License: Custom FSL license (free for academic use)
   - Source: https://fsl.fmrib.ox.ac.uk/fsl/fslwiki/Licence

5. SimpleITK - Image filtering
   - License: Apache 2.0
   - Source: https://simpleitk.org/

6. DIPY - Non-Local Means denoising
   - License: BSD
   - Source: https://dipy.org/

