EUCAIM Project Context:
This tool is developed and provided to the EUCAIM (European Cancer Image Platform) project, which aims to establish a federated infrastructure for cancer imaging data across Europe. The tool supports standardized image preprocessing workflows to ensure data quality and reproducibility in multi-center research studies.

